## Phase 5: Verification + Certification (W5–W6)

> **Goal:** Implement the multi-layer verification pipeline described in spec §11.

### Task 5.1 — Schema Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Verify that the candidate's TypeScript types are compatible with `TutorialBlock` union, `TutorialDocument`, and `BlockComponentProps` |
| **Acceptance** | TypeScript compilation succeeds with the new block type added to the union |

### Task 5.2 — Renderer Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Verify that `TutorialBlockRenderer` correctly routes `{type, version}` to the new block component. Verify unsupported versions throw errors. |
| **Use** | `verifyRegistryRendererRuntime()` from discovery package |
| **Acceptance** | Verification returns `PASS` for correct routing, `FAIL` for missing route |

### Task 5.3 — Composer Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Verify that the new block appears in the Composer registry, is discoverable via `getBlockType()`, has a default payload, and can be selected |
| **Acceptance** | `getBlockType('objective')` returns the ObjectiveO1 entry with valid default payload |

### Task 5.4 — UBRC Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Parse the candidate component and verify it renders `data-block-id`, `data-block-type`, `data-block-version` attributes |
| **Use** | AST analysis or regex scan of the component source |
| **Acceptance** | All three UBRC attributes present with correct values |

### Task 5.5 — Theme/Brand Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Verify candidate uses `theme.primary`/`theme.secondary` and does NOT contain hardcoded brand colors, logos, or URLs |
| **Use** | `brand-scanner.ts` and `theme-scanner.ts` from discovery package |
| **Acceptance** | Zero brand violations found in candidate files |

### Task 5.6 — ILS Boundary Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Verify candidate does NOT import ILS providers, does NOT call ILS APIs directly, does NOT persist learning state |
| **Key check** | Scan imports for `ILSProvider`, `ILSService`, `trackLearning`, etc. |
| **Acceptance** | Zero ILS direct-dependency violations |

### Task 5.7 — LSNB/RSSB Boundary Verification

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **What to do** | Verify candidate does NOT create navigation components, progress bars, or page-level UI |
| **Acceptance** | Zero LSNB/RSSB boundary violations |

### Task 5.8 — Certification Gate

| Detail | Value |
|---|---|
| **Directory** | `services/project-ai/app/certification/` |
| **What to do** | Aggregate all verification results. Gate logic: ALL required verifications must PASS. Any FAIL → BLOCKED. Any missing verification → BLOCKED (not PASS). |
| **Key rule** | Never fabricate PASS. Always link to evidence. |
| **Acceptance** | Gate returns `CERTIFICATION_READY` only when all verifications pass with evidence |

